{"id":"vod_sn_35635","vodId":"35635","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"编舟记","name_cn":"编舟记","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0059fc61c3d2dc4510f82aaa9c51e01a.jpg"},"summary":"马缔光也（樱井孝宏 配音）是一位性格非常内向的年轻人，总是无法很好的通过语言来传达自己的想法。可是这样的他偏偏进入了公司的第1营业部，每天的工作都让光也感到压力非常巨大。一天，光也意外的在大街上遇见了名为西冈正志（神谷浩史 配音）的男子，这个看似轻浮又油嘴滑舌的男人，竟然是辞典编辑部的一员。　　正志在光也的身上发现了校编辞典的天赋，于是邀请他加入编辑部，开始了对于辞典《大渡海》的校编，光也就此结识了对文字爱得深沉的荒木公平（金尾哲夫 配音）、将自己的一生都投注到了辞海中去的松本朋佑（麦人 配音）以及性格非常努力务实的佐佐木薰（榊原良子 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JvXsCVjnLP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GT8nFiNMnM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NcS2h3WAb41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wQKTrcJxVR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tLwZmKAgGe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c9SrgtK7tW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XS9AyB4Zwi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H5WS7FajvM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pjr7Wps4Qs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ze1wQU9BTu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yLhNzUU3A71/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.882Z"}